  {
   "key": "0x3F",
   "name": "UART mode",
   "aliases": [],
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
     "lines": "812-824"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
     "lines": "135"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
     "lines": "279-282"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
     "lines": "329"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The $3F command sets a simple UART mode in which the MPU-401 no longer recognizes any command except SYSTEM RESET ($FF), and all functions, timers and tables are disabled.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
       "lines": "813-816",
       "sha": "c643ed78d3b6f540bb7e5c1b2393278a9797ff8a0869fc43c543c7e183e41d89"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "UART mode makes the MPU-401 act as a simple UART, so that the MIDI bus can be accessed directly by the HOST.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
       "lines": "816-821",
       "sha": "26e7efd8dcff4512cbdab68d83b16d41df12ae6dce222d51e6faf2a493ecec53"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "To return to normal MPU-401 operation use SYSTEM RESET ($FF); the MPU-401 does not return an ACK in this one case.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
       "lines": "822-824",
       "sha": "8059a6db6355fa3f8bdc9e66a046c2117c354c21c15d58e3a52cee8c0d3972ce"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Writing $3F switches the MPU-401 into UART mode.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
       "lines": "816-821",
       "sha": "26e7efd8dcff4512cbdab68d83b16d41df12ae6dce222d51e6faf2a493ecec53"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "closed": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
     "lines": "812",
     "as": "layout"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
     "lines": "279-282",
     "as": "agrees",
     "row": "4"
