  {
   "key": "0xFF",
   "name": "Reset",
   "aliases": [],
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
     "lines": "1320-1333"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
     "lines": "269-278"
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
     "lines": "288"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "RESET returns the MPU-401 to its POWER-UP condition, clearing all switches and values and resetting all buffers; the capture splits the sentence across two columns.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1320-1326",
       "sha": "2d19fbcae375c6a20f0c1365b449d0e49ad36687fe1c9292f750b768a8fb3422"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1327-1333",
       "sha": "da0a9eb9760e4604bbb3ef19b905c70dd76f8aac3ebf8dc408722e116cbb6aa3"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Writing $FF resets the MPU-401 and it returns an ACK ($FE).",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1321-1324",
       "sha": "767f519016a6fac27f3ab8e4f71ef39f964be5cbaac14fe5b474084456d85f99"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:MPU401-TRM.raw.txt",
       "lines": "1329-1333",
       "sha": "92e39fe52e3c758d689bc239fa5d5e2642571c71a43ef8e99636149e1aaaee56"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "text": "The reset is carried out, and in UART mode no ACK is queued: that path returns before it.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
       "lines": "269-278",
       "sha": "6f08409be94e4d654ce9185ad05e38b259b67c6e3db682ecff8122fff5f1e3d2"
      },
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mpu401.cpp",
       "lines": "288",
       "sha": "233325b7eaa703784d269f25239a9582180795bb6605b40ad65513e69832c7cc"
      }
     ],
     "vs": "differs",
     "row": "2"
    }
   ],
